id: pm-cimph7
title: "Preserve Unicode and isolate completion data in Bash, Zsh and Fish"
description: Second PR 1279 review found Bash surrogate splitting and Zsh source injection. Native Fish execution reproduced equivalent static type/tag injection and obsolete stderr redirection. Harden all shell parsing stages and require native-shell smoke acceptance.
