author: "harness:codex"
acceptance_criteria: Astral Unicode survives generated Bash execution; static Zsh values cannot escape source or argument-spec parsing; existing completion contracts and full required gates pass; Native Fish and Zsh execution keeps adversarial completion metadata inert
parent: pm-ul5lph
severity: high
repro_steps: Generate Bash with an emoji tag; generate Zsh with an apostrophe and shell syntax in a static tag or type.
resolution: "Preserve Bash Unicode, isolate static Zsh/Fish choices and runtime flags, quote Fish fallbacks and modernize stderr redirection; require native shell smoke acceptance."
expected_result: Completion metadata remains literal and Unicode survives all supported shell renderers.
actual_result: "110 focused tests and 31 native Fish/Zsh cases pass, as do both linked tests, four TypeScript projects, 17-step temporary lifecycle, npm/Bun installed sessions and nine npx/bunx package workflows. Local full-run timeout passes separately; final exact coverage and performance gates remain required in PR 1279."
